  <ym-title|Free Maxwell collar Ward identities \V draft
  evidence><label|free-maxwell-collar-ward-identities--draft-evidence>

  Source pin <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Parent
  session <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>, issue #26. Text:
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/free-maxwell-ward-flux.tex>.

  <section|Source route and exact scope><label|source-route-and-exact-scope>

  All declarations in the following table have namespace
  <verbatim|YM.Maxwell.Free> unless explicitly qualified. The file prefix is
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Next/MAXWELL/>.

  <block|<tformat|<twith|table-width|1par>|<twith|table-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|bottom>|<table|<row|<cell|<strong|Argument>>|<cell|<strong|Declarations>>|<cell|<strong|Files>>>|<row|<cell|Polarized
  stress, Bianchi cancellation and current
  divergence>|<cell|<verbatim|cross>, <verbatim|force_sym>,
